# PQ-012: Acid remobilises phosphate previously captured by calcium
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H3PO4 0.0003mol
add v1 NaOH 0.0008mol
add v1 CaCl2 0.0006mol
inspect v1
new
filter v1 v2
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.0015mol
inspect
